{
  "info": {
    "name": "SmartTask API",
    "_postman_id": "6f0f3a4e-5d0b-4d5e-9a57-2b7f6c1d9e10",
    "description": "Smart Task Management API v1.\n\nSetup:\n1. Import `SmartTask.postman_environment.json`, select it and set `email`/`password`.\n2. Run **Auth / Get CSRF token**, then **Auth / Login**. The access token is stored in `{{accessToken}}` and sent as a Bearer token by every request in this collection.\n3. Requests that create resources store their ids and row versions (`projectId`, `taskId`, `commentId`, `attachmentId`, `*RowVersion`) for the following requests.\n\nCookies: register/login/refresh/logout rely on the `smarttask.csrf` and `smarttask.refresh` cookies (Path `/api/`). Keep Postman's cookie jar enabled for `localhost`. Access tokens expire after a few minutes; run **Refresh session** to get a new one.\n\nFor local HTTPS with the ASP.NET development certificate, disable SSL certificate verification or trust the dev cert.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get CSRF token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/csrf",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "csrf"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Run first. Sets the `smarttask.csrf` cookie and stores `requestToken` in `{{csrfToken}}`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const vars = pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables;",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.requestToken !== undefined) vars.set('csrfToken', json.requestToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{csrfToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Postman User\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Requires the `smarttask.csrf` cookie (stored by Postman's cookie jar after `Get CSRF token`) and the matching `X-CSRF-TOKEN` header from `{{csrfToken}}`. New accounts receive the Team Member role. Sets the `smarttask.refresh` cookie."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const vars = pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables;",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.accessToken !== undefined) vars.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  if (json.userId !== undefined) vars.set('userId', json.userId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{csrfToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Requires the `smarttask.csrf` cookie (stored by Postman's cookie jar after `Get CSRF token`) and the matching `X-CSRF-TOKEN` header from `{{csrfToken}}`. Stores the access token in `{{accessToken}}` and sets the `smarttask.refresh` cookie. Rate limited (10 requests per minute)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const vars = pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables;",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.accessToken !== undefined) vars.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  if (json.userId !== undefined) vars.set('userId', json.userId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh session",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{csrfToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Requires the `smarttask.csrf` cookie (stored by Postman's cookie jar after `Get CSRF token`) and the matching `X-CSRF-TOKEN` header from `{{csrfToken}}`. Uses the HttpOnly `smarttask.refresh` cookie; the token is rotated on every call and replaying an old one revokes the session."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const vars = pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables;",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.accessToken !== undefined) vars.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-CSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{csrfToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Requires the `smarttask.csrf` cookie (stored by Postman's cookie jar after `Get CSRF token`) and the matching `X-CSRF-TOKEN` header from `{{csrfToken}}`. Revokes the refresh token and clears the cookie."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const vars = pm.environment.name ? pm.environment : pm.collectionVariables;",
                  "vars.set('accessToken', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Current user",
